[
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "专题3 系统函数及应用"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                93,
                413,
                112
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "考点1：系统函数的定义及意义"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                122,
                478,
                142
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1、定义："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                155,
                233,
                171
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "H (s) = \\frac {R (s)}{E (s)}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/798b0d74c38af182987bb52ac807936c85ee0f39dab1b4a762ce503826bc2ef1.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                440,
                181,
                556,
                218
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "零状态响应的拉氏变换与激励的拉氏变换之比。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                225,
                564,
                244
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、物理意义："
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                277,
                275,
                294
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "系统函数的逆拉氏变换即为系统的冲激响应，即  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "h(t) = \\mathcal{L}^{-1}[H(s)]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                304,
                734,
                323
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "h(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 为冲激响应，取决于系统本身的结构，描述了系统的固有性质；  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 也仅仅决定于系统结构，  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 是表征系统特性的重要参数。冲激响应  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "h(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 与系统函数  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 从时域和变换域两方面表征了同一系统的特性。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                142,
                332,
                850,
                406
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "对给定的激励  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，其零状态响应为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r_{zs}(t)=\\mathcal{L}^{-1}[H(s)E(s)]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                414,
                678,
                434
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "考点2：系统函数的求解"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                468,
                408,
                489
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1、定义法：给定系统的输入和零状态响应，严格按照两者拉氏变换结果之比求解；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                500,
                848,
                546
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、直接由冲激响应求，即  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)=\\mathcal{L}[h(t)]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                556,
                524,
                574
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3、从零状态系统的微分方程出发，两端取拉氏变换求  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，即  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)=\\frac{R(s)}{E(s)}=\\frac{\\text{右边形式}}{\\text{左边形式}};"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                583,
                850,
                650
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4、从零状态s域电路模型出发，按基本定义式求响应的拉氏变换与激励的拉氏变换的比，即  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H(s)=\\frac{R(s)}{E(s)}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ;【后续学习】"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                142,
                659,
                848,
                715
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5、从系统的框图/流图出发，通过梅森公式直接写出系统函数。【后续学习】例 16：已知激励信号为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t)=e^{-t}u(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，零状态响应为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t)=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}e^{-t}-e^{-2t}+2e^{3t}\\right)u(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，求系统函数。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                722,
                821,
                741
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "B站up：信号与系统_谷哥"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
